    "title": "Man discovered missing from FCI Jesup's satellite camp - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Summer Swanson ,\n15 hours ago JESUP, Ga. (WTOC) - Tuesday afternoon at approximately 4:30 p.m., a man was discovered missing from the satellite camp adjacent to the Federal Correctional Institution (FCI) Jesup. Arthur Cofield is 34 years old with black hair, brown eyes, is 5’4” tall and weighs approximately 210 pounds. The United States Marshals... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
